[1.002, "o", "\r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[1;4mTicket Categorization\u001b[m\r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[m\u001b[m#\u001b[m\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;240m│\u001b[m\u001b[mTicket                                \u001b[m\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;240m│\u001b[m\u001b[mCategory \u001b[m\r\r\n\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;240m─\u001b[m\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;240m┼\u001b[m\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;240m──────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;240m┼\u001b[m\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;240m─────────\u001b[m\r\r\n\u001b[38;5;41m1\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;240m│\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;81m\"My invoice shows the wrong amount\"   \u001b[m\u001b[38;5;240m│\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;81m\u001b[1mBilling\u001b[m  \u001b[m\r\r\n\u001b[38;5;41m\u001b[48;5;235m2\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;240m│\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;81m\u001b[48;5;235m\"The app crashes when I upload a file\"\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;240m│\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;81m\u001b[48;5;235m\u001b[1mTechnical\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\r\n\u001b[38;5;41m3\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;240m│\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;81m\"I can't reset my password\"           \u001b[m\u001b[38;5;240m│\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;81m\u001b[1mAccount\u001b[m  \u001b[m\r\r\n\u001b[m\r\r\n\u001b[1;4mPattern Summary\u001b[m\r\r\n\r\r\nThe three tickets map one-to-one onto the three support categories, with no overlap:\r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[1m•\u001b[m \u001b[1mBilling\u001b[m issues concern financial transactions (invoice amounts"]
[0.000, "o", ", charges, pay"]
[0.000, "o", "ments).\r\r\n\u001b[1m•\u001b[m \u001b[1mTechnical\u001b[m issues concern product functionality and behavior (crashes, bugs, errors).\r\r\n\u001b[1m•\u001b[m \u001b[1mAccount\u001b[m issues concern access and identity (passwords, login, profile management).\r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[1mOverall pattern:\u001b[m These tickets represent the three fundamental dimensions of customer support — \u001b[3mmoney\u001b[m (billing), \u001b[3mproduct\u001b[m\r\r\n(technical), and \u001b[3maccess\u001b[m (account). Each ticket is cleanly classifiable by its core subject: ticket 1 is about a \u001b[1mcharge\r\r\ndiscrepancy\u001b[m, ticket 2 about a \u001b[1msoftware defect\u001b[m, and ticket 3 about \u001b[1mauthentication/access\u001b[m. A useful triage heuristic emerges:\r\r\nidentify what the customer is blocked on — payment, functionality, or access — to route the ticket to the right team.\r\r\n"]
